        "original_id": "1c8ee8ec-6921-5dba-a585-4a7ea5aa9e4b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ozzy Osbourne, Curt Smith, Roland Orzabal\n- Organizations: Black Sabbath, Tears for Fears\n- Works: Change\n- Topics: solo music careers, single releases\n\nFacts:\n- Ozzy Osbourne was born on 3 December 1948 and is an English singer, songwriter, and actor.\n- Change was written by Roland Orzabal, sung by Curt Smith, and released as Tears for Fears' fourth single.\n- Black Sabbath fired Ozzy Osbourne in 1979.\n- Ozzy Osbourne later had a successful solo career and released 11 studio albums, with his first seven studio albums receiving multi-platinum certifications in the United States.\n- Curt Smith has released four solo albums as a solo artist.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
